          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A sustained drop in Gulf crude exports impairs Chinese energy security and prompts Beijing to accelerate bilateral supplier deals and naval/logistical deployments while the U.S. counters with intensified diplomacy, arms sales and sanctions—raising bilateral strategic-economic competition within months." />
