          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Repeated sabotage and cyberattacks on energy terminals, trading platforms and clearing systems force suspensions, raise settlement failures and margin calls, widening bid-ask spreads and reducing the ability of market makers to trade, thereby reducing overall market liquidity." />
