          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An uptick in hybrid operations tied to Russia–Ukraine escalation (cyber, sea denial, proxy sabotage) mobilises and normalises similar tactics among aligned non‑state actors and contractors in the Gulf, raising the measured frequency and intensity of attacks on regional energy infrastructure." />
