          <attvalue for="32" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="28" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A spike in Russia‑linked hybrid attacks (cyber/sabotage) on energy and industrial targets prompts US policymakers to rapidly broaden and tighten export controls on dual‑use cyber, industrial‑control and security‑relevant technologies (including stricter end‑use/end‑user rules that also target transfer channels through third parties such as Chinese firms)." />
