          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="As trade rules, standards and regulatory regimes diverge, governments accelerate administrative rulemaking (new standards, procurement rules, compliance regimes) to protect domestic industries and align with preferred blocs." />
