          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sudden stops or reversals in cross-border flows, or the imposition of capital controls, prompt affected investors and firms to file international arbitration and domestic lawsuits challenging government actions and restrictions." />
